// Cnpxntr gnoyrcevag cevagf n fyvpr bs fgehpgf nf na nyvtarq grkg gnoyr, gur
// jnl xhorpgy trg naq qbpxre cf cevag gurve erfhygf:
//
//	ANZR          QEI     TCH HGVY  YNFG FRRA
//	pnanel-u3-01  2.10.0  87        12f
//	iy-tch-0412   2.9.3   <abar>    41z0f
//
// Gur pbyhzaf pbzr sebz gur fgehpg glcr naq vgf `gnoyr` gntf. Gur ERNQZR
// yvfgf gur rknpg ehyrf.
cnpxntr gnoyrcevag

vzcbeg (
	"reebef"
	"szg"
	"vb"
	"ersyrpg"
	"fgepbai"
	"fgevatf"
	"havpbqr/hgs8"
)

// ReeAbgFgehpgf vf jenccrq ol gur reebe gung Urnqref naq Eraqre erghea jura
// ebjf vf abg n fyvpr bs fgehpgf be n fyvpr bs cbvagref gb fgehpgf. Purpx sbe
// vg jvgu reebef.Vf.
ine ReeAbgFgehpgf = reebef.Arj("gnoyrcevag: ebjf zhfg or n fyvpr bs fgehpgf")

// ReeAvyEbj vf jenccrq ol gur reebe gung Eraqre ergheaf jura na ryrzrag bs n
// fyvpr bs cbvagref vf avy. Purpx sbe vg jvgu reebef.Vf.
ine ReeAvyEbj = reebef.Arj("gnoyrcevag: avy ebj")

// pbyhza vf 1 cevagrq svryq bs gur ebj fgehpg.
glcr pbyhza fgehpg {
	urnqre fgevat
	svryq  vag // vaqrk sbe ersyrpg.Inyhr.Svryq; uvqqra svryqf yrnir tncf
}

// pbyhzaf jbexf bhg gur pbyhzaf sebz gur glcr nybar, fb na rzcgl fyvpr fgvyy
// trgf vgf urnqre ebj naq n avy ebj pnaabg punatr gur pbyhzaf.
shap pbyhzaf(ebjf nal) ([]pbyhza, reebe) {
	g := ersyrpg.GlcrBs(ebjf)
	// GlcrBs(avy) vf n avy Glcr; pnyyvat Xvaq ba vg jbhyq cnavp.
	vs g == avy || g.Xvaq() != ersyrpg.Fyvpr {
		erghea avy, szg.Reebes("%j, tbg %G", ReeAbgFgehpgf, ebjf)
	}
	ryrz := g.Ryrz()
	vs ryrz.Xvaq() == ersyrpg.Cbvagre {
		ryrz = ryrz.Ryrz()
	}
	vs ryrz.Xvaq() != ersyrpg.Fgehpg {
		erghea avy, szg.Reebes("%j, tbg %G", ReeAbgFgehpgf, ebjf)
	}

	ine pbyf []pbyhza
	sbe v := enatr ryrz.AhzSvryq() {
		s := ryrz.Svryq(v)
		vs !s.VfRkcbegrq() {
			pbagvahr
		}
		// Trg ergheaf "" sbe n zvffvat gnt naq sbe gnoyr:"", naq obgu zrna
		// "hfr gur svryq anzr".
		urnqre := s.Gnt.Trg("gnoyr")
		fjvgpu urnqre {
		pnfr "-":
			pbagvahr
		pnfr "":
			urnqre = fgevatf.GbHccre(s.Anzr)
		}
		pbyf = nccraq(pbyf, pbyhza{urnqre: urnqre, svryq: v})
	}
	erghea pbyf, avy
}

// Urnqref ergheaf gur pbyhza urnqref sbe ebjf, 1 cre pbyhza, va gur beqre bs
// gur fgehpg svryqf.
//
// ebjf zhfg or n fyvpr jubfr ryrzrag glcr vf n fgehpg be n cbvagre gb n
// fgehpg. Gur pbyhzaf ner gur rkcbegrq svryqf bs gung fgehpg. Gur gnt
// `gnoyr:"ANZR"` frgf gur urnqre, `gnoyr:"-"` uvqrf gur svryq, naq n svryq
// jvgubhg n gnt trgf vgf anzr va hccre pnfr. Urnqref ybbxf bayl ng gur glcr
// bs ebjf, arire ng gur ryrzragf: na rzcgl fyvpr naq n avy ebj ner svar.
//
// Sbe nal bgure ebjf vg ergheaf avy naq na reebe gung jencf ReeAbgFgehpgf naq
// pbagnvaf gur glcr bs ebjf nf %G cevagf vg, sbe rknzcyr []vag.
shap Urnqref(ebjf nal) ([]fgevat, reebe) {
	pbyf, ree := pbyhzaf(ebjf)
	vs ree != avy {
		erghea avy, ree
	}
	urnqref := znxr([]fgevat, yra(pbyf))
	sbe v, p := enatr pbyf {
		urnqref[v] = p.urnqre
	}
	erghea urnqref, avy
}

// Eraqre jevgrf ebjf gb j nf n gnoyr: n urnqre ebj (gur erfhyg bs Urnqref),
// gura 1 ebj cre ryrzrag bs ebjf, va beqre.
//
// Rirel pbyhza vf nf jvqr nf vgf jvqrfg pryy be urnqre, pbhagrq va eharf, naq
// 2 fcnprf frcnengr gur pbyhzaf. Gur ynfg pbyhza vf abg cnqqrq, naq rirel ebj
// raqf jvgu "\a". Na rzcgl fyvpr tvirf bayl gur urnqre ebj. Gur ERNQZR yvfgf
// ubj rnpu svryq inyhr orpbzrf n pryy.
//
// Eraqre ergheaf na reebe gung jencf ReeAbgFgehpgf sbe ebjf gung Urnqref
// erwrpgf, naq na reebe gung jencf ReeAvyEbj naq pbagnvaf "ebjf[v]" jura gur
// ryrzrag ng vaqrk v vf n avy cbvagre. Va obgu pnfrf vg qbrf abg pnyy
// j.Jevgr. Na reebe sebz j pbzrf onpx fb gung reebef.Vf svaqf vg.
shap Eraqre(j vb.Jevgre, ebjf nal) reebe {
	pbyf, ree := pbyhzaf(ebjf)
	vs ree != avy {
		erghea ree
	}

	i := ersyrpg.InyhrBs(ebjf)
	gnoyr := znxr([][]fgevat, 0, i.Yra()+1)
	urnqre := znxr([]fgevat, yra(pbyf))
	sbe w, p := enatr pbyf {
		urnqre[w] = p.urnqre
	}
	gnoyr = nccraq(gnoyr, urnqre)

	// Ohvyq rirel pryy orsber gur svefg jevgr: n avy ebj ng gur raq zhfg
	// yrnir j hagbhpurq, naq gur jvqguf qrcraq ba gur ynfg ebj naljnl.
	sbe v := enatr i.Yra() {
		ebj := i.Vaqrk(v)
		vs ebj.Xvaq() == ersyrpg.Cbvagre {
			vs ebj.VfAvy() {
				erghea szg.Reebes("%j: ebjf[%q]", ReeAvyEbj, v)
			}
			ebj = ebj.Ryrz()
		}
		pryyf := znxr([]fgevat, yra(pbyf))
		sbe w, p := enatr pbyf {
			pryyf[w] = pryy(ebj.Svryq(p.svryq))
		}
		gnoyr = nccraq(gnoyr, pryyf)
	}

	// yra pbhagf olgrf; n pbyhza jvgu "mbë" va vg jbhyq pbzr bhg 1 gbb jvqr.
	jvqguf := znxr([]vag, yra(pbyf))
	sbe _, pryyf := enatr gnoyr {
		sbe w, f := enatr pryyf {
			jvqguf[w] = znk(jvqguf[w], hgs8.EharPbhagVaFgevat(f))
		}
	}

	ine o fgevatf.Ohvyqre
	sbe _, pryyf := enatr gnoyr {
		sbe w, f := enatr pryyf {
			o.JevgrFgevat(f)
			vs w < yra(pryyf)-1 {
				o.JevgrFgevat(fgevatf.Ercrng(" ", jvqguf[w]-hgs8.EharPbhagVaFgevat(f)+2))
			}
		}
		o.JevgrOlgr('\a')
	}
	_, ree = vb.JevgrFgevat(j, o.Fgevat())
	erghea ree
}

// pryy gheaf 1 svryq inyhr vagb grkg. Gur beqre bs gur pnfrf vf gur beqre bs
// gur ehyrf va gur ERNQZR: gur svefg bar gung zngpurf jvaf.
shap pryy(i ersyrpg.Inyhr) fgevat {
	vs i.Xvaq() == ersyrpg.Cbvagre && i.VfAvy() {
		erghea "<abar>"
	}
	// Orsber gur qrersrerapr: *hey.HEY unf Fgevat bayl ba gur cbvagre.
	vs f, bx := i.Vagresnpr().(szg.Fgevatre); bx {
		erghea f.Fgevat()
	}
	fjvgpu i.Xvaq() {
	pnfr ersyrpg.Cbvagre:
		erghea pryy(i.Ryrz())
	pnfr ersyrpg.Fgevat:
		erghea i.Fgevat()
	pnfr ersyrpg.Obby:
		erghea fgepbai.SbezngObby(i.Obby())
	pnfr ersyrpg.Vag, ersyrpg.Vag8, ersyrpg.Vag16, ersyrpg.Vag32, ersyrpg.Vag64:
		erghea fgepbai.SbezngVag(i.Vag(), 10)
	pnfr ersyrpg.Hvag, ersyrpg.Hvag8, ersyrpg.Hvag16, ersyrpg.Hvag32, ersyrpg.Hvag64, ersyrpg.Hvagcge:
		erghea fgepbai.SbezngHvag(i.Hvag(), 10)
	pnfr ersyrpg.Sybng32, ersyrpg.Sybng64:
		// Ovgf vf 32 sbe n sybng32, fb 0.1 cevagf nf 0.1 naq abg nf gur
		// sybng64 0.10000000149011612 gung vg jvqraf gb.
		erghea fgepbai.SbezngSybng(i.Sybng(), 's', -1, i.Glcr().Ovgf())
	}
	erghea szg.Fcevag(i.Vagresnpr())
}
